Package: rsdocs
Title: Documentation Website as an RStudio Addin
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Florian", "Schwendinger", email = "florian.schwendinger@quintik-tech.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ships a pre-rendered Quarto website and opens it from the
    RStudio (Server) Addins menu, served by a local background web server
    and proxied by RStudio Server to the user's browser.
